  "name": "Fresh Apple Salsa",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, tangy fruit salsa with toasted walnuts and fresh chiles",
  "description": "Combine tart apples with lime, aromatics, chiles, cilantro, and walnuts for a bright snack or appetizer.",
